Package: dsCohortConstructor
Title: DataSHIELD Server Functions for 'CohortConstructor'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("dsDarwin", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "karectl@lthtr.nhs.uk")
Description: Server-side DataSHIELD functions that wrap 'CohortConstructor' from
    DARWIN EU. They run in the Rock R server next to an OMOP CDM and return only
    disclosure-checked results.
